  "id": "death-by-inches",
  "title": "Death by Inches",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Our first offering is the complete 34 episode horror audio drama Death By Inches: Emotional Baggage. Eavesdrop on voice mail from poor Ryan as he renovates an isolated mansion. By the time he realizes he's not alone, unearthly fog and floodwaters trap him. Why are there hidden rooms in the attic? What's in the mysterious trunk surrounded by arcane symbols? How come gaps in Ryan's memory are replaced by nightmare scenes? Will he fall victim to the supernatural or starve first? Ghosts are bad, but there are worse terrors. It's our past that haunts us most. It's going to be a long Halloween.",
